, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "395453121030677"}]}, "change_log": "\ud83d\ude80 Features & Improvements\n\n- Organization users can now decimate Blend files and import their subdivision data.", "created_date": 1784816195, "id": "26684583867885111", "version": "6.6.901", "version_code": 11109, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1587090851394426", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26684583867885111"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "395453121030677"}]}, "change_log": "General\n\n\ud83d\ude80 Features & Improvements\n\n- Added an option to add all layers in an import to one layer group\n- Added an option to lock all layers in an imported object\n\n\ud83d\udc1b Bug Fixes\n\n- Fixed being able to attempt to delete something in your selection which was also being grabbed or edited by someone else\n\nVR\n\n\ud83d\ude80 Features & Improvements\n\n- Made the object position in the Object Info panel always display in metres if using metric measurements\n\n\ud83d\udc1b Bug Fixes\n\n- Stopped users without an org licence from creating new room in teams they were a guest member of\n\nScreen App\n\n\ud83d\ude80 Features & Improvements\n\n- Added a Materials panel that allows you to edit the color, texture and other properties of objects in the Room\n- Added a mouse cursor when drawing a section view\n- Added Ctrl/Cmd +/- shortcut to zoom the camera in and out\n\n\ud83d\udc1b Bug Fixes\n\n- Moving a newly imported object via the gumball no longer also rotates the camera\n- Updated the button on reconnect screen to reference the new Gravity Sketch website\n- Fixed being unable to scroll the Layers menu if your cursor was over the name of a layer\n- Fixed the \u201cTop-down\u201d and \u201cBottom-up\u201d light direction options not immediately changing the lighting without further input\n- Fixed the confirmation window becoming too tall when deleting a layer group containing many layers", "created_date": 1784627673, "id": "26658359603840871", "version": "6.6.900", "version_code": 11108, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1587090851394426", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26684583867885111"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1784561322, "id": "26649574391386059", "version": "6.6.900", "version_code": 11107, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1587090851394426", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26684583867885111"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1784550853, "id": "26647983861545112", "version": "6.6.900", "version_code": 11106, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0},